Combined all 16 converted functions from `guides/1/all.R/*.json` (bkde, bkde2D, bkfe, blkest, cpblock, dpih, dpik, dpill, linbin, linbin2D, locpoly, rlbin, sdiag, sstdiag, plus the `.onAttach`/`.onUnload` hooks) into `r2py_kernsmooth/__init__.py`. Key decisions:

- **Imports**: deduplicated and sorted into stdlib (`math`, `sys`, `warnings`, `typing.Any`) → third-party (`numpy`, `scipy.stats`) → local (`from . import _KernSmooth`, verified against `meson.build` which builds the extension as `_KernSmooth`, matching the pre-existing stub exactly).
